    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Interrogation Conclave",
    "summary": "Each enemy unit within 6\" of one of your **CHAPLAIN** units must take a **battle-shock roll** whenever that **CHAPLAIN** unit has **destroyed** an enemy unit in a Fight phase. Your **CHAPLAIN** units also gain Sower of Dread (Aura), which gives each enemy unit within 6\" of a **CHAPLAIN** unit -1 to its Leadership.\n\nThe only Chapter whose **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units may join an army using this Detachment is **DARK ANGELS**.",
